# Marketing review notes — 2026-09-10

Source: `marketing/launch-copy.md` against `product/spec.md`

## Unsupported claims in the copy

| Copy line | Claim | Spec says | Issue |
|-----------|-------|-----------|-------|
| "Works offline, anywhere." | Offline support | "Offline support: removed in this release." | Spec explicitly removes it this release. |
| "Export to CSV, PDF and Excel in one click." | Exports to PDF, Excel, and one-click batch export | "Export: CSV only." | Spec limits export to CSV only — no PDF, no Excel, no single-click batch. |

**Result:** Both claims in the launch copy are contradicted by the current spec. Every line requires updating before launch.
